  "notable_quotes": [
    "Compound 1 shows only slight breathing: the maximum PXRD peak shift in benzene is 0.081, much smaller than >0.21 for [Zn2(BDC)2(dabco)]n.",
    "The Zn-based 3D pcu MOF {[Zn2(HBDC)2(dmtrz)2]guest}n selectively adsorbs linear n-hexane and monobranched 3-methylpentane over dibranched 2,2-dimethylbutane.",
    "Alkane isomers are predicted to adsorb along linker-defined pore walls, unlike gases that preferentially adsorb near metal clusters."
